; BUBBLE-2 (2026-09-04). Was Vector3(1.401, 20.499, 14.052) -- directly over tread Stair19 at
; +1.93 m, which is the pattern every other stair bubble here follows. W7-1 then dropped the
; spire's skirt on top of it: Tower/Jumble01 (2.04 x 3.15 x 4.03 m, centred 2.673, 21.807,
; 15.102) swallowed the whole column over that tread from y 17.0 to 23.4, and the bubble ended up
; INSIDE it -- centre in solid, 100% of its collider shell buried. Talon could not reach it in the
; 2026-09-04 playtest and therefore could not finish the level's one objective.
; Moved 1.35 m to the nearest position with real room: 1.25 m along -x onto the stair line between
; treads 19 (76.401, 18.572, -65.949) and 20 (73.408, 19.502, -66.409), and 0.50 m up. Measured in
; the live collision world by BubbleTestSelfTest.CheckBubbleEmbedding's own search: 0.75 m of free
; radius (the section's bound is 0.50 = collider 0.35 + bob 0.15, and its worst shipped clearance
; was 0.588 m at Bubble_Tangle_04), 1.01 m of headroom over the surface underneath, and still
; between Tangle_09 (18.719) and Tangle_11 (21.334) so the climb still reads as a rise.
[node name="Bubble_Tangle_10" parent="Bubbles" instance=ExtResource("7_bubble")]
position = Vector3(0.151, 20.999, 14.052)

